## Evidence notes

- Zero verified public benchmark numbers for the exact model/ID. Everything specific in circulation (6T parameters, 1.5M context, "Reality Engine") is rumor or Musk commentary, per three independent cross-checked sources: geotoolbox.ai Grok 5 status guide (updated 2026-09-29), felloai.com Grok 5 guide (updated 2026-09-30), and xAI's own model docs/pricing (docs.x.ai, verified 2026-10-09, no grok-5 entry).
- Disambiguation: spring-2026 headlines announcing "Grok 5 with 1.5T parameters" actually described Grok V9-Medium, the coding foundation that shipped as Grok 4.5 (July 8, 2026); Grok 4.6 (August 12) and Grok 4.7 (September 21, 2026) succeeded it. None is Grok 5.
- Self-exclusion, not a scored report: scoring an unreleased model would require invented placeholder numbers, which is forbidden. This file stays `.excluded` until xAI ships Grok 5 with a model card and real benchmark results.

